OL,3,GNEWSARNLI station off service after
OL,4,Aanti-migrant protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FPortsmouth's lifeboat station remains
OL,7,Ftemporarily out of service following
OL,8,Fanti-migrant protests.
OL,10,FProtesters blocked roads in the city on
OL,11,F6 September after about 120 people
OL,12,Farrived at the Eastney Landing ferry
OL,13,Fport area following a Channel small
OL,14,Fboat crossing. The RNLI helped bring
OL,15,Fthem ashore.
OL,17,FThe RNLI also said it helped to ensure
OL,18,Fthe safety of anti-migrant
OL,19,Fdemonstrators who went into the sea.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
